  take on Jane Austen’s iconic Sense and Sensibility: a charming\, witty\
 , and deeply relatable story of love and sisterhood starring Daisy Edgar-J
 ones and Esmé Creed-Miles.\nhttps://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/sense-
 and-sensibility\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
