DESCRIPTION:You’re invited to a special screening of “Your Attention Pl
 ease”\, a film about parents\, educators\, and young people fighting bac
 k against Big Tech—and building something better for our kids. This isn'
 t a doomsday doc. It's hopeful\, honest\, and it sparks real conversations
  about the future we want to create. Join us and be a part of this importa
 nt conversation.\nhttps://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/your-attention-pl
 ease\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/your-attention-please
